  "body": "Discussion on the list:\nhttps://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/public-whatwg-archive/2015Aug/thread.html#msg26\nhttps://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/public-whatwg-archive/2015Sep/thread.html#msg1\nhttps://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/public-whatwg-archive/2015Oct/thread.html#msg25\n\nGiven that WebKit has `webkitPreservesPitched` and Gecko has `mozPreservesPitch`, simplify specifying `preservesPitch` seems like a reasonable path forward. The initial state should be true.\n\nAn open question is when (if) to reset the state. It doesn't look like WebKit or Gecko ever do reset it.\n\nCC @rocallahan @upsuper @eric-carlson\n",
